WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.934
-Guys, we have
exactly six shows left before

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:04.701
we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time for

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:06.067
that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:08.667
It's time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.133
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:12.534
♪ 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:16.968
♪ Six days left ♪

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.133
-That is right.

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.734
Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:22.934
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.200
a stunning
Christmas sweater from the

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.767
Countdown to Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.601
Now, since there are
six shows left,

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:31.567
let's open door number 6.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.868
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:35.033
Whenever you're ready.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.968
Alright.
♪♪

00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:40.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:43.033
I don't understand.

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:46.267
I don't quite -- Wow!

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:49.567
Wow!

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:51.033
Oh, and it -- Turn it.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:54.467
So, it comes
with a hat on the back.

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:57.300
-Whoo!

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.300
-You can't wear it.
You can't wear it.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.868
It's stuck to the sweater.
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:03.934
-Interesting. That's an
interesting way to do it.

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:06.200
Now let's see who's going to go
home with tonight's sweater.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.601
Everyone look
at your seat number.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:09.033
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:10.467
Quest,
can I get a drumroll, please?

00:01:10.467 --> 00:01:11.567
Who wants this great sweater?

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:13.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:21.501
Come on down!

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:22.968
Yes, come over here.

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:24.968
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:32.033
Welcome!

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:37.267
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:39.534
This is it.

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:41.033
This is it.
What is your name?

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.767
-Tori.
-Tori, where are you from?

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:45.901
-I'm from Boston.
-From Boston! We love Boston!

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:49.801
It does get
a little chilly in Boston,

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.567
so this will go perfect.

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:55.534
Are you a cow-- Do you like
country and being a cowboy?

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:56.834
-I guess I do now.
-Yes, of course.

00:01:56.834 --> 00:01:57.868
-Yeah.
-Yeah, it's yours now.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:59.334
Would you like to try it on?

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:00.501
We'd love to, yeah.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:01.567
I think there might be
one more button.

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:03.267
-Yeah, one more button.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:04.367
-I think this is
going to be great.

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:05.801
You can't wear the hat.

00:02:05.801 --> 00:02:09.000
No, the hat is just decoration.
You don't wear the hat.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.734
Oh, whoa, whoa. This is subtle.

00:02:10.734 --> 00:02:13.234
Are you kidding me?
Are you joking?

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:16.834
That is phenomenal.
Look at that!

00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:19.934
Look at that hat on the back.
That's unbelievable.

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:21.701
It looks gorgeous.

00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:22.901
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:24.033
Congratulations.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:25.267
Give her a
round of applause, everybody.

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:26.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

